ressbook><name>UNI CHARM CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UNI-CHARM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA MICHIYO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Central bodies (6, 7) forming the crotch of a trunks type wearing article (1) are respectively fabricated from first and second subsheets obtained by bisecting the width of a web along a quasi sine curve, the web being continuously fed in one direction.  The first and second subsheets are joined together at their crests of the lateral edges describing the quasi sine curve so as to form a laminated sheet, which is then cut widthwise.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On fabrique respectivement les parties centrales (6, 7) constituant la fourche d'un vêtement (1) de type caleçon à partir d'une première et d'une deuxième feuilles secondaires obtenues par division en deux parties égales de la largeur d'une bande le long d'une courbe quasi-sinusoïdale, l'alimentation en bande s'effectuant en continu dans un sens. On réunit cette première et cette deuxième feuilles secondaires au niveau de leurs crêtes des bords latéraux décrivant la courbe quasi-sinusoïdale, de façon à obtenir une feuille stratifiée qu'on coupe ensuite dans le sens de la largeur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>